{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你猜我刚才那根线还连着吗？连线上，连线上，连线上！", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.261, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 225, "total_tokens": 270, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "这秒够不够？我这就把线拉直，你拿我当奖品。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.216, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 293, "total_tokens": 334, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哼，哪能比？第二句我故意唱得轻，你听我解释。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.293, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 223, "total_tokens": 265, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "哼，那首我特意把第一句唱得慢，你听我解释。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.238, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 58, "prompt_tokens": 292, "total_tokens": 350, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "留给你？那勺子得先洗，玻璃杯得先暖。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 3.067, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 57, "prompt_tokens": 221, "total_tokens": 278, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就用勺子敲两下，玻璃杯先暖再敲。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.183, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 58, "prompt_tokens": 290, "total_tokens": 348, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜员得先帮顾客找快递，我再去帮他们找云。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.674, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 226, "total_tokens": 264, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "先帮顾客找快递，我再去帮他们找云。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.587, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 52, "prompt_tokens": 294, "total_tokens": 346, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你才说，我刚才把路挡给你了。你下次再喊，我这就把路给你。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.624, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 226, "total_tokens": 272, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就把路给你，你坐我后面。你喊左转，我这就把路给你。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.484, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 54, "prompt_tokens": 296, "total_tokens": 350, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "老板说，我昨天在食堂看到你给鱼递了个“饭”，还把它当礼物。可我说，那是你给鱼递的“饭”，鱼却把鱼当礼物。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.778, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 63, "prompt_tokens": 228, "total_tokens": 291, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "老板说，我昨天在食堂看到你给鱼递了个“饭”，还把它当礼物。可我说，那是你给鱼递的“饭”，鱼却把鱼当礼物。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.8, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 80, "prompt_tokens": 314, "total_tokens": 394, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁没注意？这扣子比我的鱼鳍还小，连我自己都懒得理它。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.998, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 223, "total_tokens": 266, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "小名？那扣子得自己说话，别指望别人听。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.193, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 55, "prompt_tokens": 295, "total_tokens": 350, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别累啦，我这就给你讲个笑话，你听我讲。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.139, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 57, "prompt_tokens": 222, "total_tokens": 279, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}, {"spoken_text": "坐着看，我在这儿，你坐哪？我在这儿，你坐哪？。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.696, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 26, "prompt_tokens": 288, "total_tokens": 314, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 154}}}]}
